WEBVTT

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:30.456
So a task may elicit lack of confidence,

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:32.886
feelings of incompetency,

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:37.074
insecurity, fear of failure, anxiety.

00:05:37.427 --> 00:05:40.346
You put that task aside,
and you've just regulated your mood.

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:42.399
Now you feel better.
It's like, "Ah, great.

00:05:42.423 --> 00:05:43.991
I don't have to think about it."

00:05:44.025 --> 00:05:46.212
AG: You know more about this than most.

00:05:46.236 --> 00:05:47.596
Do you still procrastinate?

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:51.436
FS: Yeah well, you know,
I'm human so yeah, I do procrastinate.

00:05:51.460 --> 00:05:55.166
The classic thing for me is, you know,
I've got this paper to write.

00:05:55.190 --> 00:05:59.046
And I'm thinking,
this is going to be really hard.

00:05:59.070 --> 00:06:03.026
And I build it up
into something that's really huge.